  "notes": "The exterior of the National Museum of Taiwan Literature in Tainan in June 2025. Includes the former prefectural hall, paired copper-domed towers, two masonry wings, mansards and the attached rear museum volumes. The outdoor sculpture, surrounding buildings and museum interiors are outside this architectural scope. The selected photograph shows the northwest exterior. Front design uses written building descriptions and mapped projections."
